flowchart LR
    P([Player]) --> UI[Streamlit UI<br/>room cards, stats, chat]
    UI --> IG{Input<br/>guardrail}
    IG -->|injection / admin| REF[Refusal<br/>state unchanged]
    IG -->|normal action| PARSE[Intent parse<br/>fast path or Gemini JSON]
    PARSE --> ENG[Python rule engine<br/>GameState; secrets in code]
    ENG --> NAR[Narrator<br/>streamed Gemini<br/>facts + last 3 turns]
    NAR --> OG{Output<br/>guardrail}
    OG -->|clean text| OUT[Reply shown in the UI]
    OG -->|leak or API down| TPL[Engine template<br/>shown instead]
    LLM[LLM wrapper<br/>retry, fallback, offline] -.-> PARSE
    LLM -.-> NAR
